  "notes": "Generic Mode (Mode 0, the power-up default), per Akai's APC40 Mk2 Communications Protocol v1.2. Track faders 1–3 (CC 7 on channels 1–3) = left / centre / right, master fader (CC 14) = master; track knobs 1–2 (CC 48–49) = energy and Flash level. Clip launch 1–6 (notes 0–5) = scenes, 7–8 = House/Club bank, 9 = Flash (hold), 10 = Build → Drop, 11 = first beat, 12 = cancel queue, 16 = Blackout; scene launch 1–4 = rates ¼×…2×; Stop All Clips = Stop. Unverified on hardware."
